maludb-api (0.4.1maluos8) resolute; urgency=medium

  * The unit gives a worker sixty seconds to answer uvicorn's health check
    (--timeout-worker-healthcheck 60; the default is five). On a slow or
    busy host a worker that took longer than five seconds to import was
    killed and started again without end, and the API never listened
    (found by the boot test, 2026-11-13: after a restart of the platform
    services against a database server, under emulation).

 -- Edward Honour <ed@maludb.org>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 03:40:00 +0000

maludb-api (0.4.1maluos7) resolute; urgency=medium

  * The component waits for /health by the clock (240 s) instead of thirty
    tries: a refused connection returns at once, so thirty tries were one
    minute, too short on a loaded host where a re-provisioning restarts
    every service first. The warning names the unit's state.

 -- Edward Honour <ed@maludb.org>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:30:00 +0000

